      "message": "Hello, for the June 12, 2026 visit, Keystone's EOB for claim KH-592980 shows a denial for prior authorization not on file and $1,428.70 patient responsibility. Please review whether the required prior authorization can be obtained and the claim resubmitted to Keystone. Please also send an itemized bill and place the balance on hold while the claim is reviewed. Thank you.",
