      "summary": "Ask for loyalty pricing on current internet plan",
      "message": "Hi, my 300 Mbps promotional rate of $39.99/month ended with the August 2026 bill, and my bill is now $89.99/month. Your July 10 notice advertised 300 Mbps for new customers at $39.99/month. I've been a customer through at least May 2026 and would like to stay. Can you match the $39.99/month rate or offer loyalty pricing on my current plan? Thanks.",
      "class_description": "send a message or submit a request, dispute or claim form"
    },
